WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:04.509
When a normal stress ball was placed into
the Clockworks on Fine, the result was a stress

00:00:04.509 --> 00:00:08.840
ball that, at random intervals between a minute
and five minutes in length, hurls itself at

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:11.900
the face of the person in closest proximity
to it.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.370
If the face is covered or otherwise protected,
it will alternatively aim for the stomach

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.620
or crotch.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.150
Object secured and destroyed.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:24.720
However, on Very Fine, it became a palm-sized
teddy bear, stuffed with plastic beads.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:29.110
The object is animate and seems to have a
fascination with cuddling/nuzzling ankles

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:32.630
and infrequently requests signs of affection.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.280
Object contained for further study.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:38.380
One doctor noted, “And whoever decides to
look into this farther… be nice to the little

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:38.960
guy, all right?”

